  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Salesians of Don Bosco Ireland PROJECT: The main focus of the project are the improvement of agricultural production, food security and nutrition integrating ecological production practices and techniques among refugees in Kakuma Camp, and in the host community and an effective healthcare service to improve the health status of marginalised communities in Marsabit County, and rural-urban areas in Murang&#x2019;a and Machakos counties. Training initiatives for community health promoters and lay midwives, and awareness creation will extend essential services, focusing on nutrition, hygiene, disease prevention, child and maternal care.</narrative>
  </description>
